@startuml
title UC-07 - Register a return

|Member|
start
:Bring back the borrowed copy;

|System|
:Identify the corresponding loan;
:Close the loan;

if (Return is late?) then (yes)
  :Activate extension point
  "late return";
  :Suspend the member;
else (no)
endif

if (Copy is reserved?) then (yes)
  :Keep the copy aside;
  :Notify the member who reserved it;
else (no)
endif

stop
@enduml